   "text": "Eligible Claude Enterprise orgs can claim at least $10,000 in Code Review credits by Jan 15. Credits expire 30 days after you claim them.\n\nTerms: https://t.co/NJKKFJsCKo",
   "url": "https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2110866213266203118"
