   ],
   "text": "What\u2019s new at GA\n\n- Speed: most reviews finish about 3x faster than in research preview\n- Quality: more of the bugs that matter, with concise findings that state the problem, the trigger and the fix\n- Flexibility: admins choose Quick, Standard or Deep for each repo",
