   "text": "Code Review is now generally available for Claude Team and Enterprise plans. \n\nReviews are now faster, catch more of the bugs that matter, and admins can pick from Quick, Standard, or Deep review levels for each repo. https://t.co/RO4tDC4U1U",
   "url": "https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2110866210573386065"
