     "type": "quoted"
    }
   ],
   "text": "Opus 5.5 fast mode in the Claude Platform is no longer in research preview, and we\u2019ve removed the waitlist!\n\nIt\u2019s the same Opus 5.5 but up to 2.5x faster, at $8 / $40 per million tokens.\n\nIt's also available in Microsoft Foundry (Hosted on Azure), with Google Cloud coming soon. https://t.co/oB0fhEgC88",
   "url": "https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2110825294655562048"
  },
