   "text": "The sidebar makes it easy to see which sessions are working and which ones need you. Inside a session, a live to-do list follows Claude's plan as it goes, a recap card sums up the turn when Claude needs you, and the side rail shows where it runs, its context and its changes. https://t.co/uJ5zBJGbZu",
   "url": "https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2110445851466485786"
